# Jazzberry Jam EEW System

A portable, low-cost **Earthquake Early Warning (EEW)** device that detects the P-wave of an earthquake on-device, sounds a local alarm, and relays the alert to neighboring devices over **LoRa radio**, with no internet connection required. The repo also contains a React dashboard for live and replayed data, and a C++ test harness that validates the detection algorithms against real seismograph recordings.

