## Repository Structure

```
Jazzberry_Jam_EEW_System/
├── platformio.ini            # PlatformIO build config (ESP32 / TTGO T-Beam)
├── src/                      # Firmware implementation (.cpp)
│   ├── main.cpp              # Entry point: pin map, object wiring, setup()/loop()
│   ├── EEWStateMachine.cpp   # Top-level MONITORING / ALERT / ERROR logic
│   ├── accelADC.cpp          # Accelerometer sampling, calibration, unit conversion
│   ├── biquad.cpp            # 2-stage IIR band-pass filter
│   ├── STALTA.cpp            # STA/LTA event trigger
│   ├── taucpd.cpp            # τc and Pd estimator
│   ├── Alert.cpp             # Buzzer/LED + LoRa alert send/receive/dedup
│   └── radio.cpp             # SX1276 LoRa wrapper (RadioLib)
├── include/                  # Firmware headers (one per .cpp above)
├── lib/, test/               # PlatformIO placeholders (unused)
├── ui/                       # React + Vite live dashboard
│   ├── src/App.jsx           # Main dashboard (charts, playback, USB controls)
│   ├── src/lib/usbPacketListener.js  # Web Serial reader / JSON packet parser
│   ├── src/components/ui/    # shadcn-style UI primitives
│   └── public/*_u.json       # Pre-processed earthquake recordings for replay
└── testing/                  # Desktop algorithm validation
    ├── Makefile
    ├── src/parsers/smcparser.cpp   # Parser for .smc strong-motion files
    ├── src/smc_replay_util.cpp     # Replays recordings through the firmware algorithms
    ├── tests/                      # Catch2 tests
    ├── data/20021103_2212_uncorr/  # Real 2002 Denali Fault quake recordings (.smc)
    └── output/*.json               # Replay results consumed by the UI
```

